title: Exploring CMIP6 Climate Model Data
abstract: This cookbook demonstrates how to access, analyze, and visualize CMIP6 climate model datasets. It includes two complementary notebooks: Exploring CMIP6 Climate Data, which introduces the use of the catalog for querying and accessing multi-model historical simulations, and Exploring CMIP6 Surface Temperature, which focuses on near-surface air temperature (tas) analysis.